                                                "sense_id": "0181d2c1-e29c-323f-aa6f-68a08bfd89ea",
                                                "text": "I'll have just a titch more cake."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0cccf576-d316-469d-b3d7-1cda0925c73a",
                                                "sense_id": "0181d2c1-e29c-323f-aa6f-68a08bfd89ea",
                                                "text": "“...and just a titch of my special pepper sauce over these turnip greens, everybody loves turnip greens.”"
                                            }
