                                                "sense_id": "b660f72e-2916-3ef9-86bb-50d1ba657047",
                                                "text": "Vur Bob eszul wis awful titch'd\n An went jist like a hoss a witch'd."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d5d53890-e6fb-4615-9a03-823a9e6cb43b",
                                                "sense_id": "b660f72e-2916-3ef9-86bb-50d1ba657047",
                                                "text": "There was some sort of affray between you and Flood. The constables separated you. What led to this?\n […] I titched Noah and Noah titched me and my hat falled off."
                                            }
