                                                "sense_id": "e3d79bb6-1201-3755-a36a-5d78786b7ccf",
                                                "text": "Let's 'ave a look at some of them titchy ones."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9a6f73c3-9527-43c4-b62d-76f452d445d6",
                                                "sense_id": "e3d79bb6-1201-3755-a36a-5d78786b7ccf",
                                                "text": "'Haven't you got little feet?' I said. 'Has everybody got titchy plates in Belgium?'"
